; Output: COMMENT.M
; Console: COMMENT.OUT
; PMDMML.MAN §1-4, §16-5, §16-6

#Title COMMENT
#Option /v/c

; §16-5 Comment Specification (;) (Used throughout)
A c d e ; This is a comment until end of line

; §16-6 Comment Specification 2 (`)
A c d ` This is a comment ` e f ; Block/inline comment toggle
`                       ; Block comment start
A f4 g4 a4              ; Inside the block, not compiled
B f g                   ; Inside the block, not compiled
`                       ; Block comment end
A a b                   ; Not skipped

`
;skipped header comment in first pass
`

; Backtick block comment in cmloop2 (second pass scan)
`
A this line is skipped by backtick
`
A f g a b

; Backtick block comment crossing multiple commands
A c d ` skipped stuff here ` e f

; Backtick block comment test
A ` this is skipped ` c d e f g
